---
import ContentLayout from "../layouts/ContentLayout.astro";
---

<ContentLayout title="sidequests | rohanth marem" description="Side quests, random projects, and things Rohanth does for fun.">
  <section class="tbc-hero tbc-fu tbc-d2">
    <h1 class="tbc-hero-text">sidequests</h1>
    <p class="tbc-about-intro" style="margin-top: 12px">
      things i do for fun, or just because.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="tbc-section tbc-fu tbc-d4" style="padding-top: 28px; padding-bottom: 64px">
    <div class="tbc-about-copy">
      <ul class="tbc-about-list">
        <li>
          <span class="tbc-sidequest-title">speedrunning a quarter-life crisis</span>
          {" — "}recently ran a{" "}
          <a href="https://www.strava.com/activities/18363105986" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="tbc-about-tag tbc-tag-b">half marathon</a>
          {" "}and have this unreasonably ambitous desire to become ironman by the time i'm 20.
        </li>
        <li>
          <span class="tbc-sidequest-title">living to eat instead of eating to live</span>
          {" — "}i've always been whatever the opposite of a picky eater is and was satisfied with whatever slop i could make. trying to get out of this habit by trying new foods (check my{" "}
          <a href="https://beliapp.co/app/rohanth" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="tbc-about-tag tbc-tag-b">beli</a>
          {") and cooking real food"}
        </li>
        <li>
          <span class="tbc-sidequest-title">taking more photos</span>
          {" — "}i don't take enough photos and its a terrible problem, so been trying to take more. dabbling with film, and i love it but its soo expensive
        </li>
        <li>
          <span class="tbc-sidequest-title">buffalo wild wings</span>
          {" — "}trying wings at every airport buffalo wild wings in the usa (currently done: MSP, DFW, ATL). my order is always the wings with blazin' sauce
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>
</ContentLayout>
